---
import SectionLabel from "./SectionLabel.astro";
---

<section class="section" id="problem">
  <div class="shell" data-reveal>
    <SectionLabel label="The Problem" />
    <h2>The software gap that slows businesses down.</h2>
    <div class="problem-split">
      <div>
        <div class="copy-grid">
          <p>
            Hiring in high-cost markets can quickly become expensive. A full-time developer or
            agency in the US, UK, Canada, or Western Europe often means recruitment time, high
            monthly cost, management overhead, onboarding, and long-term commitment — before a
            single useful feature ships.
          </p>
          <p>
            But going cheap creates a different risk. You may still face unclear scope, silent
            weeks, missed launches, messy handoff, and software nobody can maintain after the
            developer leaves. The real problem is not just cost. It is paying for work you
            cannot see, control, or confidently use.
          </p>
        </div>

        <p class="problem-highlight">
          CodeVault gives founders and small teams a focused build partner: clear scope,
          visible progress, practical delivery, and clean handoff — without the overhead of
          building an engineering department too early.
        </p>

        <div class="problem-compare" aria-label="Comparison of software delivery options">
          <div>
            <p class="problem-compare-title">Full-time hire</p>
            <p>High cost · recruitment overhead · management load</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="problem-compare-title">Cheap outsourcing</p>
            <p>Low visibility · unclear handoff · quality risk</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="problem-compare-title">CodeVault</p>
            <p>Focused scope · visible progress · clean delivery</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="illustration-wrap problem-illustration-wrap">
        <img
          src="/illustrations/2.svg"
          alt="Founder dealing with software project complexity"
          class="section-illustration problem-illustration"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
